      "notes": "Compact read-only work-record summary view for selected WK or slice context. The default summary is the compact-first path: it keeps tracker records bounded while preserving routing details such as dependencies, write_scope, acceptance, validation, owners, review_state, blockers, omission counts, and recommended next calls. For tracker WK-level summaries, select a narrower unit such as <WK-ID>#<slice-id> to read that slice's notes and bounded detail. Expensive full-summary/debug requests against large trackers are refused unless the call follows the compact-first progressive-disclosure contract or is narrowed to selected unit/slice detail.",
